{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109891","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109891/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109891/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109891/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109891","id":3347054408,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6k-IKa","number":109891,"title":"Metal: Read `gl_ViewIndex` in tonemapper.glsl for multi-view subpasses","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097519,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1MTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:ios","name":"platform:ios","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097780,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc3ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:macos","name":"platform:macos","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":865585000,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4NjU1ODUwMDA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:xr","name":"topic:xr","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-08-22T23:14:36Z","updated_at":"2025-08-28T19:44:29Z","closed_at":"2025-08-24T16:08:28Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109891","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109891","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109891.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109891.patch","merged_at":"2025-08-24T16:08:27Z"},"body":"This is necessary to ensure the SpvCapabilityMultiView is included in the SPIR-V, informing downstream transpilers, like Metal, that it should enable multi-view capabilities in the generated Metal shader source.\r\n\r\n\r\n| before | after |\r\n| :---- | :---- |\r\n| <img alt=\"CleanShot 2025-08-23 at 09 12 59@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7e5732e8-2744-424d-b4ad-6762f768abed\" /> | <img alt=\"CleanShot 2025-08-23 at 09 13 39@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3fcfd3a3-7237-4a5f-b08e-0458bcd7523c\" /> |\r\n\r\nThe issue is that if the `gl_ViewIndex` is not accessed, this code isn't executed in the GLSL compiler:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/940d62907027f388026ba2cac1ac64381af5c78f/thirdparty/glslang/SPIRV/GlslangToSpv.cpp#L911-L914\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE]\r\n>\r\n> This happens before any type of optimisation, so _hopefully_ the capability remains in the SPIR-V if SPIR-V optimizer passes are added at a later date. For example, the [`TrimCapabilities`](https://github.com/KhronosGroup/SPIRV-Tools/blob/8a8bb6c89174ed753eb18a438092ee59356efc3c/source/opt/trim_capabilities_pass.h#L77-L112) pass for SPIRV-Tools does **not** strip multi-view capabilities 👍🏻 \r\n\r\nIf we do add a optimiser passes in the future, we'd want to modify the `reflect_spirv` function, but I'd rather not do this so late in the 4.5 cycle:\r\n\r\n```patch\r\nIndex: servers/rendering/rendering_device_commons.cpp\r\nIDEA additional info:\r\nSubsystem: com.intellij.openapi.diff.impl.patch.CharsetEP\r\n<+>UTF-8\r\n===================================================================\r\ndiff --git a/servers/rendering/rendering_device_commons.cpp b/servers/rendering/rendering_device_commons.cpp\r\n--- a/servers/rendering/rendering_device_commons.cpp\t(revision 90c913487595b7f688c0c642e931d9f82b6e85a9)\r\n+++ b/servers/rendering/rendering_device_commons.cpp\t(date 1755905011000)\r\n@@ -994,6 +994,13 @@\r\n \t\t\tERR_FAIL_COND_V_MSG(result != SPV_REFLECT_RESULT_SUCCESS, FAILED,\r\n \t\t\t\t\t\"Reflection of SPIR-V shader stage '\" + String(SHADER_STAGE_NAMES[p_spirv[i].shader_stage]) + \"' failed parsing shader.\");\r\n \r\n+\t\t\tfor (uint32_t j = 0; j < module.capability_count; j++) {\r\n+\t\t\t\tif (module.capabilities[j].value == SpvCapabilityMultiView) {\r\n+\t\t\t\t\tr_reflection.has_multiview = true;\r\n+\t\t\t\t\tbreak;\r\n+\t\t\t\t}\r\n+\t\t\t}\r\n+\r\n \t\t\tif (r_reflection.is_compute) {\r\n \t\t\t\tr_reflection.compute_local_size[0] = module.entry_points->local_size.x;\r\n \t\t\t\tr_reflection.compute_local_size[1] = module.entry_points->local_size.y;\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109891/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109891/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}